    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d999">

                <pb facs="0937" n="623" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg623"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111/446</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of the Treasury</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >McAdoo</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Treasury Department</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-13">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">October 13, 1914</hi>.</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to enclose herewith a
                    copy of a telegram, dated the 10th instant, from the collector of customs at San
                    Francisco further in regard to the cargo of coal of the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Mazatlan</hi>, which it appears ultimately reached the German cruiser <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Leipzig</hi>.</p>
                <p>I will thank you for advice of any action that you may desire taken in the matter
                    by this department or its customs officers.</p>
                <p>A copy of the collector’s telegram has also been forwarded to the Attorney
                    General for such instructions to the United States Attorney or other action, if
                    any, as he may deem necessary.</p>
                <p>By direction of the Secretary,</p>
                <p>Respectfully,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. J. Peters</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Assistant Secretary</hi>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d999-a1.xml" xpointer="d999-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
